  "title": "Cube storage bookshelf 4x4, 1470",
  "description": "White 4x4 cube storage unit (Kallax style), 1470 x 390 x 1470, with 20 mm panels on a 362 pitch. The diagonal cubes hold books and four lower cubes hold fabric storage boxes. Its origin is the back-left-bottom corner.",
